// ADOSCStream is a live ADOSC over a growing series: [ADOSCStream.Update] takes
// each new closed bar and returns the value [Core.ADOSC] computes at that bar
// over the same series. Open one with [Core.ADOSCOpen] or
// [Core.ADOSCOpenAndFill].
